; Opera Agent - registry install for the pinned extension, Windows only.
; @last-edited: 2026-11-12 UTC+7.
; @title: extension registry install - one double-click writes three keys; one browser restart installs the extension.
; @state: Windows; per-user (HKCU), admin rights not required. Verified 2026-11-12 on Chrome 153.0.8010.36, Brave 157.1.99.56, and Edge (x86) against isolated throwaway profiles.
; @dependencies: Windows, an internet connection on the first browser start, and a browser whose user profile is not policy-managed to forbid external installs.
; This file is data; double-click it or run: reg import extension-registry-install.reg
; Remove the trigger again with extension-registry-uninstall.reg, then remove the extension in chrome://extensions.

Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

